OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the boy with Formula One     
OL,4,Adreams                                 
OL,6,FAn 11-year-old boy is starting to turn 
OL,7,Fheads in the world of motorsport as he 
OL,8,Fconsistently beats competitors with    
OL,9,Fmore experience and money.             
OL,11,FWilliam Robinson, from Somerset, has   
OL,12,Fdriven in 47 karting races, and brought
OL,13,Fhome 41 trophies.                      
OL,15,FBut if his dream of winning the Formula
OL,16,FOne world title is to come true, he    
OL,17,Fwill have to buck the trends of the    
OL,18,Ffinancially-driven sport.              
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
