OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the boy with Formula One     
OL,4,Adreams                                 
OL,6,FSimply practicing at a track can cost  
OL,7,Fhundreds, if not thousands of pounds - 
OL,8,Flimiting William to one session per    
OL,9,Fmonth. However, his mother Rebecca said
OL,10,Fshe believed he will prove that talent 
OL,11,Fgets to F1, not just how deep your     
OL,12,Fpockets are.                           
